Z||000000||phillip||03-16-2000||07:25 PM||||<BR>because i got a pretty good deal on some of those huge exhaust tips (i know they're import boy items but i like 'em) , i recently switched to a dual exhaust. every shop i went to insisted that my only choice was a stock fiero gt exhaust. i'm always hoping to do an engine switch in the future and am wondering how big an engine i can install and not over power the exhaust or have the exhaust be too much of a restriction to a bigger engine. thanks for any help.||||reg||1
